// The invariants of `gopp fmt` (see roundtrip.test) on the sema test inputs
// that are valid programs, in two tests (this one and roundtrip-rules.test):
// the corpus grew past the 2 s limit of one test. This one has the top-level
// tests and the .gopp inputs of Inputs and conformance. It is in two shards
// (this one and roundtrip-sema-2.test: the files whose place in the sorted
// list is 0 and 1 modulo 2), as one run took 1.5 s of the 2 s limit.
// RUN: %python %S/check-corpus.py %gopp --ext .test --min 7 --shard 0/2 %S/../sema/*.test %S/../sema/Inputs %S/../sema/conformance
